---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_ii1_278",
  "series": "Band II 1 (1663 - 1685)",
  "seq": 278,
  "text": "<p> [[850.1]] <b>243. LEIBNIZ AN VEIT LUDWIG VON SECKENDORFF</p>\n<p> [[850.2]] 24. Dezember 1683 / 3. Januar 1684. [242.249.]</b></p>\n<p> [[850.21]] [ ... ] Consilium in Scripto vernaculo et exoterico abstinendi Metaphysicis argumentis,\n[[850.22]] quae tuendae Divinae naturae, atque immortalis animae gratia afferri possunt, plane laudo. De\n[[850.23]] caetero apud Viros meditationum capaces, id est suo loco, magnam et in illis vim esse arbitror\n[[850.24]] et multos in Gallia et Batavis novi, qui valde illis capiuntur. Nec a Scholasticis inventa, sed jam\n[[850.25]] inde a Pythagora et Platone frequentata apud philosophos et fortasse cum animarum transmigratione\n[[850.26]] (corruptela praeclarae veritatis) a Pythagora ex oriente in Graeciam allata puto.\n[[850.27]] Platonis certe <i>Phaedonem</i> atque alia scripta, ubi talia pulcherrime tractantur, et mirifica arte\n[[850.28]] disserendi plana ac facilia redduntur, saepe magno animi assensu legi, et argumenta illa de\n[[850.29]] reminiscentia seu quod eodem redit notitia aeternarum veritatum ex sensibus non pendentium,\n[[851.1]] de fluxa ac minime substantiali natura materiae ac rerum materialium, ac <greek>perì th̃w ay̆tokinh́sevw</greek>\n[[851.2]] plus habere in recessu puto, quam vulgo animadvertitur. Tametsi agnoscam Platonem\n[[851.3]] plerumque in probandi conatu deficere, et passim fabulas illorum temporum captui\n[[851.4]] accommodatas admiscere. Sed istis diutius immorandi non est locus. [ ... ] </p>\n",
  "number": "243.",
  "title": "LEIBNIZ AN VEIT LUDWIG VON SECKENDORFF",
  "date": "24. Dezember 1683 / 3. Januar 1684. [242.249.]"
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:243. LEIBNIZ AN VEIT LUDWIG VON SECKENDORFF 24. Dezember 1683 / 3. Januar 1684. [242.249.] [ ... ] Consilium in Scripto vernaculo et exoterico abstinendi Metaphysicis argumentis, quae tuendae Divinae naturae, atque immortalis animae gratia afferri possunt, plane laudo. De caetero apud Viros meditati...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>